          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "4.1 原文实现（1 索引风格，对 a[1..n] 排序）"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "41-原文实现1-索引风格对-a1n-排序"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "go",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "func insertionSort(a []int, n int) {\n\t// 对 a[1],a[2],...,a[n] 进行插入排序\n\tfor i := 2; i <= n; i++ {\n\t\tkey := a[i]\n\t\tj := i - 1\n\t\tfor ; j > 0 && a[j] > key; {\n\t\t\ta[j+1] = a[j]\n\t\t\tj--\n\t\t}\n\t\ta[j+1] = key\n\t}\n}"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "4.2 标准 0 索引 Go 实现"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "42-标准-0-索引-go-实现"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "go",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "func insertionSort(nums []int) {\n\tfor i := 1; i < len(nums); i++ {\n\t\tkey := nums[i]\n\t\tj := i - 1\n\t\t// 已排序部分从右往左扫描，比 key 大的元素后移\n\t\tfor j >= 0 && nums[j] > key {\n\t\t\tnums[j+1] = nums[j]\n\t\t\tj--\n\t\t}\n\t\tnums[j+1] = key\n\t}\n}"
      },
